   "widgets_values": [
    "⚗ RESOLUTION LADDER — same prompt, same seed\n\n2.5 / 3 / 4 / 5 MP. Estimated times on a 5070 Ti: ~35 / ~45 / ~60 / ~80 s.\n\nWhat to look at, at 100% on the cheek and the eye:\n- pores getting finer and more numerous? then resolution pays off;\n- repeated patterns, identical pores, scaly hair? the model is going\n  beyond its training (1024 px native);\n- the framing changes: that is normal, the latent has a different size.\n\nIf 5 MP runs out of memory, bypass that column (Ctrl+B)."
   ],
   "title": "⚗ AlchemicaMente · notes"
